<TeXmacs|2.1.4>

<style|<tuple|tmweb2|english|old-spacing|old-dots|old-lengths>>

<\body>
  <tmweb-current|Plug-ins|All><tmweb-title|Plug-ins for GNU
  <TeXmacs>|<tmweb-plugin-links>>

  Many plug-ins for external software exist for GNU <TeXmacs>. Some native
  plugins that are <hlink|free|http://www.gnu.org/philosophy/free-sw.html> in
  the sense of the <acronym|FSF> are as follows:

  <\enumerate>
    <item><hlink|Asymptote|graphics.en.tm#asymtote>

    <item><hlink|Axiom|cas.en.tm#axiom>

    <item><hlink|Cadabra|physics.en.tm#cadabra>

    <item><hlink|Eukleides|graphics.en.tm#eukleides>

    <item><hlink|Ghostscript|graphics.en.tm#ghostscript>

    <item><hlink|Giac|cas.en.tm#giac>

    <item><hlink|GTybalt|cas.en.tm#gtybalt>

    <item><hlink|Macaulay 2|cas.en.tm#macaulay2>

    <item><hlink|Maxima|cas.en.tm#maxima>

    <item><hlink|Octave|numerics.en.tm#octave>

    <item><hlink|Pari|cas.en.tm#pari>

    <item><hlink|Qcl|physics.en.tm#qcl>

    <item><hlink|R|statistics.en.tm#r>

    <item><hlink|Reduce|cas.en.tm#reduce>

    <item><hlink|Sage|cas.en.tm#sage>

    <item><hlink|TeXgraph|graphics.en.tm#texgraph>

    <item><hlink|Xfig|graphics.en.tm#xfig>

    <item><hlink|Yacas|cas.en.tm#yacas>
  </enumerate>

  We refer to<nbsp><slink|https://github.com/texmacs/plugins> for a more
  complete list of both internally and externally maintained plugins.

